          {{ stats.macarthurFellows }} MacArthur Fellows, National Medal of Science recipients, and leading voices across every discipline.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Unrehearsed, intellectually rigorous conversation with peers from other fields</li>
          <li>Professionally produced video recording shared freely with global audiences</li>
          <li>A legacy archive joining {{ stats.speakers }} of the world's leading minds</li>
          <li>The intimate setting of the {{ site.address.venue }}</li>
          <li>An engaged live audience and active post-discussion Q&amp;A</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="participate-card">
        <h3>For Audiences &amp; Students</h3>
